    robin "哦哇！今天真是陽光明媚。"

# game/storybeat.rpy:659
translate chinese_traditional story_beat3_967f77a7:

    # pro "Yeah, but it's almost the end of summer."
    pro "是啊，不過現在已經是夏天快結束的時候了。"

# game/storybeat.rpy:660
translate chinese_traditional story_beat3_e2aa4776:

