    robin "哇，這裡真漂亮。"

# game/storybeat.rpy:735
translate chinese_traditional story_beat3_89b388b4:

    # pro "Isn't it? I haven't been to a beach in ages!"
    pro "不是嗎？我好久沒去過海灘了！"

# game/storybeat.rpy:736
translate chinese_traditional story_beat3_614b4a89:

    # robin "Then we'd better make the most of it!"
    robin "那我們最好充分利用它！"

# game/storybeat.rpy:737
translate chinese_traditional story_beat3_8940671c:

    # robin "Let's set up our stuff over there!"
    robin "讓我們把東西放在那裡吧！"

# game/storybeat.rpy:738
translate chinese_traditional story_beat3_b6306487:

    # pro "Good idea, it's a perfect spot."
    pro "好主意，這是一個完美的地方。"

# game/storybeat.rpy:740
translate chinese_traditional story_beat3_8b492f2f:

    # "We find a nice spot on the beach and set up our towels."
    "我們在海灘上找到了一個好地方並準備了毛巾。"

# game/storybeat.rpy:741
translate chinese_traditional story_beat3_1c7a7ffc:

    # "The beach is packed today, with families and couples scattered about."
    "今天海灘上擠滿了人，家庭和情侶散落在各處。"

# game/storybeat.rpy:746
translate chinese_traditional story_beat3_46c5334c:

    # robin "There's a lot of people here..."
    robin "這裡有很多人..."

# game/storybeat.rpy:747
translate chinese_traditional story_beat3_964829bb:

    # pro "Yeah, looks like we weren't the only ones with the idea to go to the beach today."
    pro "是的，看來我們今天並不是唯一想到要去海灘的人。"

# game/storybeat.rpy:748
translate chinese_traditional story_beat3_be527fb7:

    # pro "Anyways, what do you want to do first Robin?"
    pro "不管怎樣，羅賓你首先想做什麼？"

# game/storybeat.rpy:749
translate chinese_traditional story_beat3_c5f6b06e:

    # robin "I don't know, what do people usually do at the beach?"
    robin "我不知道，人們通常在海邊做什麼？"

# game/storybeat.rpy:750
translate chinese_traditional story_beat3_6fb9708d:

    # robin "We could play in the water? Build a sandcastle? Take a walk?"
    robin "我們可以玩水嗎？建造沙堡？散步？"

# game/storybeat.rpy:751
translate chinese_traditional story_beat3_5c30965c:

    # pro "Any of those sound fun to me!"
    pro "這些對我來說都很有趣！"

# game/storybeat.rpy:752
translate chinese_traditional story_beat3_a308528c:

    # pro "Though, I wouldn't mind just laying out and sunbathing for a bit."
    pro "不過，我不介意只是躺下來曬一會兒日光浴。"

# game/storybeat.rpy:753
translate chinese_traditional story_beat3_11a63fbb:

    # robin "That sounds relaxing!"
    robin "聽起來很放鬆！"

# game/storybeat.rpy:754
translate chinese_traditional story_beat3_91ab1d4c:

    # robin "Let's do it!"
    robin "我們開始做吧！"

# game/storybeat.rpy:756
translate chinese_traditional story_beat3_f6796ce4:

    # "We put our towels out on the sand and lie down to sunbathe."
    "我們把毛巾鋪在沙灘上，躺下來曬日光浴。"

# game/storybeat.rpy:763
translate chinese_traditional story_beat3_cbc538fb:

    # robin "The sun feels so nice..."
    robin "陽光照射的感覺真好…"

# game/storybeat.rpy:764
translate chinese_traditional story_beat3_4cb5102b:

    # pro "Yeah, I love this kind of weather."
    pro "是的，我喜歡這樣的天氣。"

# game/storybeat.rpy:765
translate chinese_traditional story_beat3_9f23a1b8:

    # robin "It was always rainy in New York, so this is a nice change."
    robin "紐約總是下雨，所以這是一個很好的改變。"

# game/storybeat.rpy:766
translate chinese_traditional story_beat3_8f32957c:

    # robin "It's good to just get away from everything sometimes and relax."
    robin "有時擺脫一切事情並放鬆是件好事。"

# game/storybeat.rpy:767
translate chinese_traditional story_beat3_f43145b6:

    # "Robin's skin is beginning to glow in the sun, making him look even more radiant than usual."
    "羅賓的皮膚在陽光下開始發光，讓他看起來比平常更有光澤。"

# game/storybeat.rpy:768
translate chinese_traditional story_beat3_2bd2caeb:

    # "His black swimsuit makes him look so fucking sexy..."
    "他的黑色泳衣讓他看起來非常性感..."

# game/storybeat.rpy:769
translate chinese_traditional story_beat3_3b740795:

    # pro "Y-yeah, it's nice."
    pro "是的，這很好。"

# game/storybeat.rpy:770
translate chinese_traditional story_beat3_ebaea413:

    # pro "Anyways, what are you thinking about for the rest of the day?"
    pro "無論如何，今天剩下的時間你在想什麼？"

# game/storybeat.rpy:771
translate chinese_traditional story_beat3_68a33a37:

    # robin "Well, I don't really want to go for a swim or anything..."
    robin "好吧，我真的不想去游泳什麼的..."

# game/storybeat.rpy:772
translate chinese_traditional story_beat3_d12155e6:

    # robin "Maybe we could go for a walk or something."
    robin "也許我們可以去散步什麼的。"

# game/storybeat.rpy:773
translate chinese_traditional story_beat3_95dda89e:

