    # pro "You're being really sweet and trying to protect both of us from getting hurt."
    pro "你真的很貼心，並試圖保護我們倆免受傷害。"

# game/storybeat.rpy:2223
translate chinese_traditional story_beat6_5abecd56:

    # pro "That's something I really appreciate and love about you."
    pro "這是我真正欣賞和喜愛你的一點。"

# game/storybeat.rpy:2224
translate chinese_traditional story_beat6_0befbe11:

    # pro "But, I also think you're putting too much pressure on yourself to make a decision."
    pro "但是，我也認為你在做出決定時給自己施加了太大的壓力。"

# game/storybeat.rpy:2225
translate chinese_traditional story_beat6_eebfe0f4:

    # robin "How so?"
    robin "為何如此？"

# game/storybeat.rpy:2226
translate chinese_traditional story_beat6_4531aa45:

    # pro "I mean... you're already feeling anxious and stressed out about this, aren't you?"
    pro "我的意思是……你已經為此感到焦慮和壓力，不是嗎？"

# game/storybeat.rpy:2227
translate chinese_traditional story_beat6_eeb1fbd4:

    # pro "And that's not good. That's going to lead to an unhappy decision, regardless of which path you choose."
    pro "那不好。無論你選擇哪條路，這都會導致一個不愉快的決定。"

# game/storybeat.rpy:2228
translate chinese_traditional story_beat6_af6d63ea:

    # robin "But what else can I do..."
    robin "但我還能做什麼..."

# game/storybeat.rpy:2229
translate chinese_traditional story_beat6_1ed9ea77:

    # pro "Well, I think it's important for you to take the time to think things through."
    pro "嗯，我認為花時間把事情想清楚對你來說很重要。"

# game/storybeat.rpy:2230
translate chinese_traditional story_beat6_b672c8ca:

    # pro "Take the time to figure out what's best for you."
    pro "花點時間找出最適合您的方法。"

# game/storybeat.rpy:2231
translate chinese_traditional story_beat6_b378fd1a:

    # pro "And... I want to help you with that, too."
    pro "而且...我也想幫助你。"

# game/storybeat.rpy:2233
translate chinese_traditional story_beat6_0385e187:

    # robin "You do?"
    robin "你做？"

# game/storybeat.rpy:2234
translate chinese_traditional story_beat6_9ac09d66:

    # pro "Of course..."
    pro "當然..."

# game/storybeat.rpy:2235
translate chinese_traditional story_beat6_e65efcc8:

    # pro "Let me take care of you Robin."
    pro "讓我來照顧你，羅賓。"

# game/storybeat.rpy:2236
translate chinese_traditional story_beat6_091d683a:

    # pro "Let me love you and show you how wonderful it can be."
    pro "讓我愛你並向你展示它是多麼美妙。"

# game/storybeat.rpy:2237
translate chinese_traditional story_beat6_3fd36189:

    # robin "B-but how?"
    robin "但、但是怎麼辦？"

# game/storybeat.rpy:2239
translate chinese_traditional story_beat6_7c844f3d:

    # pro "You said you didn't want to have any more sex until we figured things out, right?"
    pro "你說過在我們解決問題之前你不想再發生性行為，對嗎？"

# game/storybeat.rpy:2240
translate chinese_traditional story_beat6_a99ed122:

    # pro "That means you've already chosen your answer, haven't you?"
    pro "這代表你已經選擇了答案，不是嗎？"

# game/storybeat.rpy:2241
translate chinese_traditional story_beat6_9f2551cd:

    # pro "You've just chosen the harder option to avoid taking a leap of faith."
    pro "你只是選擇了更困難的選擇來避免信仰的飛躍。"

# game/storybeat.rpy:2242
translate chinese_traditional story_beat6_9e97e6cb:

    # pro "But you need to understand that there are no right answers, only the answers that are right for us."
    pro "但你需要明白，沒有正確的答案，只有適合我們的答案。"

# game/storybeat.rpy:2243
translate chinese_traditional story_beat6_190031a7:

    # pro "I'm not trying to pressure you into a relationship, but I think it would be good for both of us to give it a try."
    pro "我並不是想強迫你建立關係，但我認為嘗試對我們雙方都有好處。"

# game/storybeat.rpy:2244
translate chinese_traditional story_beat6_93e9dc11:

    # pro "We can go as slow or as fast as you want, I'm not in a rush either."
    pro "我們可以按照你的意願走得慢或快，我也不著急。"

# game/storybeat.rpy:2245
translate chinese_traditional story_beat6_46a65d19:

    # pro "But if you want to take a risk, and you want to try for a happy ending, then I think it's worth taking a leap of faith."
    pro "但如果你想冒險，並且想嘗試一個幸福的結局，那麼我認為值得邁出信心的一步。"

# game/storybeat.rpy:2246
translate chinese_traditional story_beat6_a1ba2e62:

    # pro "I'll catch you. I'll be there for you."
    pro "我會抓住你的。我會在那等你。"

# game/storybeat.rpy:2247
translate chinese_traditional story_beat6_7bd462e9:

    # robin "..."
    robin "..."

# game/storybeat.rpy:2248
translate chinese_traditional story_beat6_531cbf7d:

    # robin "Okay..."
    robin "好的..."

# game/storybeat.rpy:2249
translate chinese_traditional story_beat6_2920f75f:

    # pro "Okay?"
    pro "好的？"

# game/storybeat.rpy:2250
translate chinese_traditional story_beat6_5b527369:

    # pro "What's okay?"
    pro "有什麼問題嗎？"

# game/storybeat.rpy:2252
translate chinese_traditional story_beat6_4b973700:

    # robin "Let's do it..."
    robin "我們開始做吧..."

# game/storybeat.rpy:2253
translate chinese_traditional story_beat6_0a1bdcaf:

    # robin "I'm willing to try."
    robin "我願意嘗試。"

# game/storybeat.rpy:2254
translate chinese_traditional story_beat6_05d819c8:

    # robin "You're right. There's no use in worrying about it."
    robin "你說得對。擔心它是沒有用的。"

# game/storybeat.rpy:2255
translate chinese_traditional story_beat6_79c95fa9:

    # robin "I just have to have a little courage."
    robin "我只需要有一點勇氣。"

# game/storybeat.rpy:2256
translate chinese_traditional story_beat6_c5e6dd3b:

    # robin "If we're meant to be, we're meant to be, and if we're not then we can move on without hurting each other."
    robin "如果我們注定如此，我們就注定如此，如果我們不是，那麼我們可以繼續前進，而不會互相傷害。"

# game/storybeat.rpy:2257
translate chinese_traditional story_beat6_7017fd2a:

    # pro "I'm so proud of you, Robin."
    pro "我為你感到驕傲，羅賓。"

# game/storybeat.rpy:2258
translate chinese_traditional story_beat6_84762869:

    # pro "This is a big step for you, and I'm glad that we can do this together."
    pro "這對你來說是一大步，我很高興我們能一起做到這一點。"

# game/storybeat.rpy:2259
translate chinese_traditional story_beat6_78b2f91d:

    # robin "Yeah, it's kind of scary, but I'm excited."
    robin "是的，這有點可怕，但我很興奮。"

# game/storybeat.rpy:2260
translate chinese_traditional story_beat6_0c67d249:

    # robin "I've never been this close with someone before, it feels nice."
    robin "我從來沒有和一個人如此親密過，這種感覺真好。"

# game/storybeat.rpy:2261
translate chinese_traditional story_beat6_17a73ef9:

    # "I still feel like he's unsure..."
    "我還是覺得他不太確定..."

# game/storybeat.rpy:2262
translate chinese_traditional story_beat6_e68f4459:

    # "Maybe he doesn't know how devoted I am to him... how much I want this to work."
    "也許他不知道我對他有多忠誠……我有多希望這一切成功。"

# game/storybeat.rpy:2263
translate chinese_traditional story_beat6_9fa56461:

    # "Maybe I should just..."
    "也許我應該..."

# game/storybeat.rpy:2265
translate chinese_traditional story_beat6_c282c949:

    # pro "Hey, Robin?"
    pro "嘿，羅賓？"

# game/storybeat.rpy:2267
translate chinese_traditional story_beat6_51813b74:

    # robin "Yeah?"
    robin "是的？"

# game/storybeat.rpy:2268
translate chinese_traditional story_beat6_a59ba08c:

    # pro "I..."
    pro "我..."

# game/storybeat.rpy:2269
translate chinese_traditional story_beat6_c29f95ca:

    # pro "I love-"
    pro "我愛-"

# game/storybeat.rpy:2272
translate chinese_traditional story_beat6_2ebe7057:

    # "Before the words can leave my mouth, I hear a loud pounding on the front door."
    "話還沒說完，我就聽到前門被重重地敲擊著。"

# game/storybeat.rpy:2273
translate chinese_traditional story_beat6_ffc4e12a:

    # robin "EEH!"
    robin "呃！"

# game/storybeat.rpy:2274
translate chinese_traditional story_beat6_39166dcf:

    # pro "Who is that..."
    pro "那是誰..."

# game/storybeat.rpy:2276
translate chinese_traditional story_beat6_fe839abf:

    # "I go to the front door and check through the peephole."
    "我走到前門，透過貓眼檢查。"

# game/storybeat.rpy:2277
translate chinese_traditional story_beat6_9dcd2c29:

    # pro "Hm, there's nobody there..."
    pro "嗯，那裡沒人…"

# game/storybeat.rpy:2278
translate chinese_traditional story_beat6_195626ba:

    # robin "W-what..."
    robin "什、什麼..."

# game/storybeat.rpy:2279
translate chinese_traditional story_beat6_a6aa8850:

    # pro "Weird..."
    pro "詭異的..."

# game/storybeat.rpy:2282
translate chinese_traditional story_beat6_bea6f56b:

    # "I open the door and look around, but there is nobody there."
    "我打開門，環顧四周，但空無一人。"

# game/storybeat.rpy:2283
translate chinese_traditional story_beat6_89a2d431:

    # robin "Whats that..."
    robin "那是什麼..."

# game/storybeat.rpy:2284
translate chinese_traditional story_beat6_e9143e8b:

    # "I look down and see a note."
    "我低頭看到一張紙條。"

# game/storybeat.rpy:2285
translate chinese_traditional story_beat6_7278c67b:

    # pro "What the fuck..."
    pro "搞什麼鬼..."

# game/storybeat.rpy:2287
translate chinese_traditional story_beat6_d9773b9d:

    # "I bend down and pick it up."
    "我彎下腰把它撿起來。"

# game/storybeat.rpy:2288
translate chinese_traditional story_beat6_de8b4b67:

    # pro "This is..."
    pro "這是..."

# game/storybeat.rpy:2289
translate chinese_traditional story_beat6_ef4d91be:

    # pro "A note addressed to Robin..."
    pro "一封寫給羅賓的便條…"

# game/storybeat.rpy:2292
translate chinese_traditional story_beat6_989be03e:

    # "I open up the letter and begin to read it to Robin."
    "我打開這封信，開始唸給羅賓聽。"

# game/storybeat.rpy:2295
translate chinese_traditional story_beat6_6e7b842b:

    # pro "'Dear my sweet Robin...'"
    pro "“親愛的我親愛的羅賓…”"

# game/storybeat.rpy:2298
translate chinese_traditional story_beat6_26e005a4:

    # pro "'I'm sorry you felt frightened by me the last time we met...'"
    pro "“很抱歉上次我們見面時你被我嚇到了……”"

# game/storybeat.rpy:2301
translate chinese_traditional story_beat6_12851fd8:

    # pro "'But you did not have to move so far from me.'"
    pro "“但你不必離我那麼遠。”"

# game/storybeat.rpy:2302
translate chinese_traditional story_beat6_9cf9d9f2:

    # robin "What the fuck."
    robin "搞什麼鬼。"

# game/storybeat.rpy:2303
translate chinese_traditional story_beat6_ee0a8adf:

    # robin "This is from my stalker..."
    robin "這是我的跟蹤者發來的..."

# game/storybeat.rpy:2304
translate chinese_traditional story_beat6_20746ca0:

    # "I read the note some more..."
    "我又讀了一些註解..."

# game/storybeat.rpy:2307
translate chinese_traditional story_beat6_82a7764b:

    # pro "'I miss you. I can't wait to see you in person again."
    pro "'我想你。我迫不及待地想再次見到你本人。"

# game/storybeat.rpy:2310
translate chinese_traditional story_beat6_66605e06:

    # pro "'See you soon, my love.'"
    pro "“很快見，我的愛人。”"

# game/storybeat.rpy:2311
translate chinese_traditional story_beat6_004bff31:

    # pro "..."
    pro "..."

# game/storybeat.rpy:2314
translate chinese_traditional story_beat6_80de6757:

    # pro "Robin... are you alright?"
    pro "羅賓……你還好嗎？"

# game/storybeat.rpy:2315
translate chinese_traditional story_beat6_abe2461d:

    # "His eyes have gone wide, and tears are welling up in them."
    "他的眼睛睜得大大的，淚水在眼眶裡打轉。"

# game/storybeat.rpy:2316
translate chinese_traditional story_beat6_b5c2d783:

    # pro "Robin, it's alright. We can figure this out. He can't get in here. You're safe."
    pro "羅賓，沒關係。我們可以弄清楚這一點。他進不去這裡。你很安全。"

# game/storybeat.rpy:2317
translate chinese_traditional story_beat6_7123960c:

    # robin "Y-Yeah, I..."
    robin "是的，我..."

# game/storybeat.rpy:2318
translate chinese_traditional story_beat6_aca41591:

    # robin "I don't feel so safe..."
    robin "我覺得不太安全..."

# game/storybeat.rpy:2319
translate chinese_traditional story_beat6_a67d8108:

    # pro "Robin..."
    pro "羅賓..."

# game/storybeat.rpy:2320
translate chinese_traditional story_beat6_3e52ff82:

    # pro "Listen to me."
    pro "聽我說。"

# game/storybeat.rpy:2321
translate chinese_traditional story_beat6_f0ee89b1:

    # pro "We're going to be okay-"
    pro "我們會沒事的-"

# game/storybeat.rpy:2322
translate chinese_traditional story_beat6_5fa99bcb:

    # robin "No... no we aren't."
    robin "不……不，我們不是。"

# game/storybeat.rpy:2323
translate chinese_traditional story_beat6_4a2fdc82:

    # robin "Fuck fuck fuck..."
    robin "他媽的他媽的..."

# game/storybeat.rpy:2324
translate chinese_traditional story_beat6_71826702:

    # robin "I can't believe he found me."
    robin "我不敢相信他找到我了。"

# game/storybeat.rpy:2325
translate chinese_traditional story_beat6_8b0ab240:

    # robin "What if he breaks in..."
    robin "萬一他闖進來怎麼辦…"

# game/storybeat.rpy:2326
translate chinese_traditional story_beat6_a67d8108_1:

    # pro "Robin..."
    pro "羅賓..."

# game/storybeat.rpy:2327
translate chinese_traditional story_beat6_feb1e3a4:

    # pro "Robin please calm down."
    pro "羅賓請冷靜。"

# game/storybeat.rpy:2328
translate chinese_traditional story_beat6_39e86371:

    # pro "Listen to me..."
    pro "聽我說..."

# game/storybeat.rpy:2329
translate chinese_traditional story_beat6_f8c31f21:

    # pro "I know it's scary, and it feels like your whole world is crashing down around you."
    pro "我知道這很可怕，感覺你周圍的整個世界都崩潰了。"

# game/storybeat.rpy:2330
translate chinese_traditional story_beat6_6fc401e7:

    # pro "But I want you to take a deep breath, alright?"
    pro "但我想讓你深呼吸，好嗎？"

# game/storybeat.rpy:2331
translate chinese_traditional story_beat6_010414c8:

    # pro "Take a deep breath..."
    pro "深吸一口氣…"

# game/storybeat.rpy:2334
translate chinese_traditional story_beat6_38cebca3:

    # "Robin runs off into his room."
    "羅賓跑進他的房間。"

# game/storybeat.rpy:2335
translate chinese_traditional story_beat6_e3fec560:

    # pro "Robin!"
    pro "羅賓！"

# game/storybeat.rpy:2338
translate chinese_traditional story_beat6_a49c57db:

    # "Robin slams the door shut."
    "羅賓關上了門。"

# game/storybeat.rpy:2339
translate chinese_traditional story_beat6_8a9c7539:

    # "Fuck, fuck..."
    "他媽的，他媽的…"

# game/storybeat.rpy:2341
translate chinese_traditional story_beat6_05c2be62:

    # "I enter the room and see Robin in the corner of his room."
    "我走進房間，看到羅賓在他房間的角落。"

# game/storybeat.rpy:2349
translate chinese_traditional story_beat6_a67d8108_2:

    # pro "Robin..."
    pro "羅賓..."

# game/storybeat.rpy:2350
translate chinese_traditional story_beat6_5ed852ca:

    # robin "I knew it... I knew he would find me..."
    robin "我知道...我知道他會找到我..."

# game/storybeat.rpy:2351
translate chinese_traditional story_beat6_2103d045:

    # robin "I knew this wouldn't last forever..."
    robin "我知道這不會永遠持續下去..."

# game/storybeat.rpy:2352
translate chinese_traditional story_beat6_f4b2dcaa:

    # robin "Shit... what do I do."
    robin "媽的……我該怎麼辦。"

# game/storybeat.rpy:2353
translate chinese_traditional story_beat6_ba0976e9:

    # robin "What do I do, [protagonist_name]?"
    robin "我該怎麼辦，[protagonist_name]？"

# game/storybeat.rpy:2354
translate chinese_traditional story_beat6_ba192134:

    # "His eyes are wide and full of terror. He is absolutely terrified."
    "他的眼睛睜得大大的，充滿了恐懼。他絕對害怕了。"

# game/storybeat.rpy:2355
translate chinese_traditional story_beat6_f558c877:

    # pro "We can't panic."
    pro "我們不能驚慌。"

# game/storybeat.rpy:2356
translate chinese_traditional story_beat6_26e40d21:

    # pro "It won't help us to panic. We have to be smart and rational. We have to figure this out together."
    pro "這不會幫助我們恐慌。我們必須聰明、理性。我們必須共同解決這個問題。"

# game/storybeat.rpy:2357
translate chinese_traditional story_beat6_439defec:

    # robin "He's out there right now."
    robin "他現在就在外面。"

# game/storybeat.rpy:2358
translate chinese_traditional story_beat6_4b2e447b:

    # robin "I'm not safe anymore. He knows I live here."
    robin "我不再安全了。他知道我住在這裡。"

# game/storybeat.rpy:2359
translate chinese_traditional story_beat6_8cca8499:

    # robin "I... I'm..."
    robin "我……我是……"

# game/storybeat.rpy:2360
translate chinese_traditional story_beat6_36b39d27:

    # robin "What do I do, I don't know what to do..."
    robin "我該怎麼辦，我不知道該怎麼辦..."

# game/storybeat.rpy:2361
translate chinese_traditional story_beat6_9272fe76:

    # "He's hyperventilating and crying now, tears streaming down his face."
    "他現在呼吸急促，哭得厲害，淚水從臉上流下來。"

# game/storybeat.rpy:2362
translate chinese_traditional story_beat6_db1c1c53:

    # robin "This is it..."
    robin "就是這個..."

# game/storybeat.rpy:2363
translate chinese_traditional story_beat6_b25b158e:

    # robin "This is my nightmare come to life."
    robin "這是我的惡夢成真了。"

# game/storybeat.rpy:2364
translate chinese_traditional story_beat6_5f766436:

    # pro "No, no... It's okay Robin... You're okay."
    pro "不，不……沒關係，羅賓……你沒事。"

# game/storybeat.rpy:2365
translate chinese_traditional story_beat6_019a028f:

    # pro "Everything will be okay."
    pro "一切都會好起來的。"

# game/storybeat.rpy:2366
translate chinese_traditional story_beat6_d80dce47:

    # pro "You just need to calm down, and we can figure this out together, okay?"
    pro "你只需要冷靜下來，我們可以一起解決這個問題，好嗎？"

# game/storybeat.rpy:2367
translate chinese_traditional story_beat6_c88bfd60:

    # pro "I'm not going to let anything happen to you, Robin. I'll make sure of it, no matter what. I'll protect you."
    pro "我不會讓你發生任何事，羅賓。無論如何，我都會確保這一點。我會保護你。"

# game/storybeat.rpy:2368
translate chinese_traditional story_beat6_18279255:

    # robin "I... I'm not safe. I need to get out of here."
    robin "我……我不安全。我需要離開這裡。"

# game/storybeat.rpy:2369
translate chinese_traditional story_beat6_d596803f:

    # robin "I need to leave."
    robin "我需要離開。"

# game/storybeat.rpy:2370
translate chinese_traditional story_beat6_6ae8dd1a:

    # robin "I need to go somewhere else where nobody knows where I am. I can't stay here."
    robin "我需要去一個沒人知道我在哪裡的地方。我不能留在這裡。"

# game/storybeat.rpy:2371
translate chinese_traditional story_beat6_3770b669:

    # robin "What if he breaks in?"
    robin "如果他闖入怎麼辦？"

# game/storybeat.rpy:2372
translate chinese_traditional story_beat6_1737112b:

    # robin "What if he tries to do something to me while I'm asleep?"
    robin "如果他想趁我睡著的時候對我做什麼怎麼辦？"

# game/storybeat.rpy:2373
translate chinese_traditional story_beat6_94c00a1e:

    # "Fuck, he's spiraling again."
    "媽的，他又在飛升了。"

# game/storybeat.rpy:2374
translate chinese_traditional story_beat6_b734da46:

    # robin "No, no... I have to leave now, I can't be here any longer..."
    robin "不，不……我必須離開，我不能再待在這裡了……"

# game/storybeat.rpy:2375
translate chinese_traditional story_beat6_ea0366dc:

    # pro "Robin, no... listen to me."
    pro "羅賓，不……聽我說。"

# game/storybeat.rpy:2376
translate chinese_traditional story_beat6_03464c09:

    # pro "You're panicking."
    pro "你很恐慌。"

# game/storybeat.rpy:2377
translate chinese_traditional story_beat6_e61d5a28:

    # pro "You can't let fear dictate what you do, that's what will get you hurt."
    pro "你不能讓恐懼決定你做什麼，否則會讓你受傷。"

# game/storybeat.rpy:2378
translate chinese_traditional story_beat6_c10f49fe:

    # robin "But..."
    robin "但..."

# game/storybeat.rpy:2379
translate chinese_traditional story_beat6_f2814e5d:

    # robin "I don't want to be hurt. I'm scared. I'm so scared..."
    robin "我不想受傷。我很害怕。我好害怕..."

# game/storybeat.rpy:2380
translate chinese_traditional story_beat6_91b09236:

    # pro "Do you trust me, Robin?"
    pro "你相信我嗎，羅賓？"

# game/storybeat.rpy:2381
translate chinese_traditional story_beat6_8dc8bc96:

    # robin "W-what?"
    robin "什、什麼？"

# game/storybeat.rpy:2382
translate chinese_traditional story_beat6_6c37f246:

    # pro "Do you trust me? Can you trust me with this?"
    pro "你相信我嗎？你能相信我嗎？"

# game/storybeat.rpy:2383
translate chinese_traditional story_beat6_57cad898:

    # robin "I trust you, but I'm not sure I trust myself..."
    robin "我相信你，但我不確定我是否相信自己..."

# game/storybeat.rpy:2384
translate chinese_traditional story_beat6_c3135f5b:

    # robin "I can't think clearly... I don't want to make the wrong decision, but I don't know what to do..."
    robin "我無法清晰地思考...我不想做出錯誤的決定，但我不知道該怎麼辦..."

# game/storybeat.rpy:2385
translate chinese_traditional story_beat6_3567a5c6:

    # pro "Then follow my lead. Do what I do, and you'll be alright."
    pro "然後跟著我的引導。做我做的事，你就會沒事的。"

# game/storybeat.rpy:2386
translate chinese_traditional story_beat6_0c1aa26a:

    # robin "But I don't want you to get hurt... or worse..."
    robin "但我不想讓你受傷…或更糟…"

# game/storybeat.rpy:2387
translate chinese_traditional story_beat6_89568f5e:

    # robin "I'm scared."
    robin "我很害怕。"

# game/storybeat.rpy:2388
translate chinese_traditional story_beat6_a9628e64:

    # pro "We're not going to get hurt. I promise."
    pro "我們不會受傷。我保證。"

# game/storybeat.rpy:2389
translate chinese_traditional story_beat6_b5e5cee4:

    # robin "You can't guarantee that... no one can."
    robin "你不能保證……沒有人能保證。"

# game/storybeat.rpy:2390
translate chinese_traditional story_beat6_e7f591e1:

    # robin "I need to go somewhere he won't find me, and then maybe we'll be safe."
    robin "我需要去一個他找不到我的地方，然後也許我們就安全了。"

# game/storybeat.rpy:2391
translate chinese_traditional story_beat6_dc6dc9d0:

    # "I have to make a decision, I have to say something."
    "我必須做出決定，我必須說點什麼。"

# game/storybeat.rpy:2392
translate chinese_traditional story_beat6_43db7b2c:

    # "Until I make a choice for Robin, he'll continue to spiral."
    "在我為羅賓做出選擇之前，他將繼續螺旋式上升。"

# game/storybeat.rpy:2447
translate chinese_traditional story_beat6_ec012af7:

    # "What should I do?"
    "我該怎麼辦？"

# game/storybeat.rpy:2459
translate chinese_traditional ending1_6f18e46b:

    # pro "Robin, listen to me."
    pro "羅賓，聽我說。"

# game/storybeat.rpy:2460
translate chinese_traditional ending1_56251f37:

    # pro "I'll confront him, if he even steps a foot near you I'll kick his fucking ass."
    pro "我會和他對峙，如果他靠近你一英尺，我就會踢他媽的屁股。"

# game/storybeat.rpy:2461
translate chinese_traditional ending1_30fd2c14:

    # pro "I'm done letting this stupid stalker psychologically torture you like this."
    pro "我受夠了這個愚蠢的跟蹤狂這樣對你進行心理折磨。"

# game/storybeat.rpy:2462
translate chinese_traditional ending1_fd1949ec:

    # pro "Let's take this fucker down."
    pro "讓我們把這個混蛋打倒吧。"

# game/storybeat.rpy:2463
translate chinese_traditional ending1_b3d003e8:

    # pro "If anything, this could be an opportunity."
    pro "如果有的話，這可能是一個機會。"

# game/storybeat.rpy:2464
translate chinese_traditional ending1_26bad9f7:

    # pro "We could set a trap, bait him into making the first move, and get the police involved."
    pro "我們可以設下陷阱，引誘他先採取行動，然後讓警察介入。"

# game/storybeat.rpy:2465
translate chinese_traditional ending1_75bfb15e:

    # robin "What..."
    robin "什麼..."

# game/storybeat.rpy:2466
translate chinese_traditional ending1_7ad18170:

    # pro "Don't you want him to face justice? Don't you want him to rot away in a cell for being such a scumbag?"
    pro "你不想讓他接受正義的審判嗎？難道你不想讓他就這麼渣，在牢房裡爛掉嗎？"

# game/storybeat.rpy:2467
translate chinese_traditional ending1_60ca6eb5:

    # robin "I... I want to forget he ever existed and hope I never see his face again."
    robin "我……我想忘記他曾經存在過，希望再也見不到他的臉。"

# game/storybeat.rpy:2468
translate chinese_traditional ending1_697e8cb8:

    # pro "I know you do, but if you just run away from it..."
    pro "我知道你會這樣做，但如果你只是逃避它......"

# game/storybeat.rpy:2469
translate chinese_traditional ending1_fa132311:

    # pro "It will always be looming over your head. And it will always have its hooks in you, tugging at you, tormenting you."
    pro "它永遠籠罩在你的頭上。它永遠會在你身上掛著鉤子，拉扯你，折磨你。"

# game/storybeat.rpy:2470
translate chinese_traditional ending1_cd0fa110:

    # robin "But... I'm so afraid. I can barely even imagine facing him alone."
    robin "但是……我很害怕。我幾乎無法想像獨自面對他。"

# game/storybeat.rpy:2471
translate chinese_traditional ending1_a38acf0f:

    # pro "You're not alone."
    pro "你並不孤單。"

# game/storybeat.rpy:2472
translate chinese_traditional ending1_507739f8:

    # pro "I'm here, always."
    pro "我就在這裡，一直都在。"

# game/storybeat.rpy:2473
translate chinese_traditional ending1_d55454f1:

    # pro "I'm here to support you."
    pro "我是來支持你的。"

# game/storybeat.rpy:2474
translate chinese_traditional ending1_0cc141e3:

    # pro "I'm here to take care of you."
    pro "我來這裡是為了照顧你。"

# game/storybeat.rpy:2475
translate chinese_traditional ending1_7bd462e9:

    # robin "..."
    robin "..."

# game/storybeat.rpy:2476
translate chinese_traditional ending1_5a1b7040:

    # pro "We need to act fast, Robin."
    pro "我們需要快速行動，羅賓。"

# game/storybeat.rpy:2477
translate chinese_traditional ending1_4545a33b:

    # robin "I don't know... I just don't know. What if I regret it?"
    robin "我不知道...我只是不知道。如果我後悔了怎麼辦？"

# game/storybeat.rpy:2478
translate chinese_traditional ending1_9a052b3a:

    # pro "Do you trust me?"
    pro "你相信我嗎？"

# game/storybeat.rpy:2479
translate chinese_traditional ending1_80617602:

    # robin "Yes, but I'm worried you'll do something stupid or reckless or—"
    robin "是的，但我擔心你會做出一些愚蠢或魯莽的事情，或者——"

# game/storybeat.rpy:2480
translate chinese_traditional ending1_06295e90:

    # pro "Robin."
    pro "羅賓."

# game/storybeat.rpy:2481
translate chinese_traditional ending1_7c8ad6f4:

    # pro "We're partners. You and me. Partners. And we're stronger together than apart."
    pro "我們是合作夥伴。你和我。合作夥伴。我們在一起比分開更強大。"

# game/storybeat.rpy:2482
translate chinese_traditional ending1_7bd462e9_1:

    # robin "..."
    robin "..."

# game/storybeat.rpy:2486
translate chinese_traditional ending1_1063c74c:

    # "Robin gets off the floor."
    "羅賓從地板上站起來。"

# game/storybeat.rpy:2487
translate chinese_traditional ending1_b3874a90:

    # robin "Alright, but if I die, I'm gonna haunt your ass as a ghost for the rest of eternity."
    robin "好吧，但如果我死了，我會像幽靈一樣永遠纏著你。"

# game/storybeat.rpy:2488
translate chinese_traditional ending1_f370dd4f:

    # pro "Deal. Let's do this."
    pro "交易。讓我們這樣做吧。"

# game/storybeat.rpy:2490
translate chinese_traditional ending1_47b08dfb:

    # "Robin has a smile on his face again."
    "羅賓臉上再次露出笑容。"

# game/storybeat.rpy:2492
translate chinese_traditional ending1_2a5a7ba2:

    # robin "So, what's the plan?"
    robin "那麼，計劃是什麼？"

# game/storybeat.rpy:2494
translate chinese_traditional ending1_ef66c50c:

    # pro "This creep clearly knows you're with someone."
    pro "這個變態清楚地知道你和某人在一起。"

# game/storybeat.rpy:2495
translate chinese_traditional ending1_f8e4eb3d:

    # pro "He's just waiting for an opportunity where you're alone before striking, that's when he has power."
    pro "他只是在等待一個只有你一個人的機會，然後再出手，那時他就有力量。"

# game/storybeat.rpy:2496
translate chinese_traditional ending1_d02d9c8c:

    # pro "Given that he was able to disappear after leaving the note, that means he is still somewhere near the building."
    pro "鑑於他在留下紙條後就消失了，這意味著他仍在建築物附近的某個地方。"

# game/storybeat.rpy:2497
translate chinese_traditional ending1_191b0d03:

    # pro "He may even be inside our apartment building, even now."
    pro "即使現在，他甚至可能就在我們的公寓大樓裡。"

# game/storybeat.rpy:2498
translate chinese_traditional ending1_7bd462e9_2:

    # robin "..."
    robin "..."

# game/storybeat.rpy:2499
translate chinese_traditional ending1_999e07c6:

    # pro "Hey, don't worry. He won't do anything until he knows you're alone and defenseless."
    pro "嘿，別擔心。在他知道你孤身一人、毫無防備之前，他不會做任何事。"

# game/storybeat.rpy:2500
translate chinese_traditional ending1_5261baf4:

    # pro "So here's my plan."
    pro "這是我的計劃。"

# game/storybeat.rpy:2501
translate chinese_traditional ending1_e482a287:

    # pro "Tonight, when it gets late, turn on your stream and pretend that I'm out of the house."
    pro "今晚，天色漸晚時，打開你的直播，假裝我不在家。"

# game/storybeat.rpy:2502
translate chinese_traditional ending1_69415f3e:

    # pro "If he's watching, this will be his chance to strike."
    pro "如果他在觀看，這將是他出擊的機會。"

# game/storybeat.rpy:2503
translate chinese_traditional ending1_e561669b:

    # pro "At least he'll think so."
    pro "至少他會這麼認為。"

# game/storybeat.rpy:2504
translate chinese_traditional ending1_8b3a9809:

    # pro "I'll hide somewhere and wait for him to appear."
    pro "我會躲在某個地方，等他出現。"

# game/storybeat.rpy:2505
translate chinese_traditional ending1_133bc4d3:

    # pro "I'll also call the cops and have them on stand-by."
    pro "我也會報警並讓他們待命。"

# game/storybeat.rpy:2506
translate chinese_traditional ending1_7a146a6d:

    # robin "That sounds so dangerous..."
    robin "聽起來好危險啊..."

# game/storybeat.rpy:2507
translate chinese_traditional ending1_7498e563:

    # robin "What if he hurts you?"
    robin "如果他傷害你怎麼辦？"

# game/storybeat.rpy:2508
translate chinese_traditional ending1_cc02856f:

    # pro "Trust me, I may look a bit scrawny but I can take care of myself."
    pro "相信我，我可能看起來有點骨瘦如柴，但我可以照顧自己。"

# game/storybeat.rpy:2509
translate chinese_traditional ending1_4585dad3:

    # robin "I hope so..."
    robin "我希望如此..."

# game/storybeat.rpy:2510
translate chinese_traditional ending1_3aa0a0fc:

    # pro "Once he shows up, I'll confront him and subdue him."
    pro "一旦他出現，我就會與他對峙並制服他。"

# game/storybeat.rpy:2511
translate chinese_traditional ending1_53335d30:

    # pro "And the cops can swoop in to finish the job."
    pro "警察可以突然介入完成任務。"

# game/storybeat.rpy:2512
translate chinese_traditional ending1_12bd033e:

    # robin "This feels like a weird dream, I can't believe this is happening..."
    robin "這感覺就像是一個奇怪的夢，我不敢相信這會發生..."

# game/storybeat.rpy:2513
translate chinese_traditional ending1_8ebc34c4:

    # pro "It's the only way. Otherwise, he'll never leave you alone."
    pro "這是唯一的辦法。不然他永遠不會丟下你一個人。"

# game/storybeat.rpy:2514
translate chinese_traditional ending1_55929a4f:

    # robin "But what if he-"
    robin "但如果他——"

# game/storybeat.rpy:2515
translate chinese_traditional ending1_06295e90_1:

    # pro "Robin."
    pro "羅賓."

# game/storybeat.rpy:2516
translate chinese_traditional ending1_9a052b3a_1:

    # pro "Do you trust me?"
    pro "你相信我嗎？"

# game/storybeat.rpy:2517
translate chinese_traditional ending1_7bd462e9_3:

    # robin "..."
    robin "..."

# game/storybeat.rpy:2518
translate chinese_traditional ending1_fdda3cea:

    # robin "Yes, I do."
    robin "是的，我願意。"

# game/storybeat.rpy:2519
translate chinese_traditional ending1_2ca947ca:

    # pro "I promise, it will be over after this."
    pro "我保證，這件事之後就結束了。"

# game/storybeat.rpy:2520
translate chinese_traditional ending1_87a28495:

    # pro "I... I love you Robin."
    pro "我...我愛你羅賓。"

# game/storybeat.rpy:2521
translate chinese_traditional ending1_5e0e9a4c:

    # robin "...!"
    robin "...!"

# game/storybeat.rpy:2522
translate chinese_traditional ending1_13bbb172:

    # robin "L... love?"
    robin "L……愛？"

# game/storybeat.rpy:2523
translate chinese_traditional ending1_7c6b9782:

    # robin "You... you love me?"
    robin "你……你愛我嗎？"

# game/storybeat.rpy:2524
translate chinese_traditional ending1_607d3540:

    # pro "Yes, I love you."
    pro "是的，我愛你。"

# game/storybeat.rpy:2525
translate chinese_traditional ending1_9b86348a:

    # pro "You're the most amazing person I've ever met. I would do anything to protect you, Robin."
    pro "你是我見過的最了不起的人。我願意做任何事來保護你，羅賓。"

# game/storybeat.rpy:2526
translate chinese_traditional ending1_fae21aec:

    # robin "I... I..."
    robin "我...我..."

# game/storybeat.rpy:2528
translate chinese_traditional ending1_f9a80488:

    # "I can see the fear in his eyes slowly turning into determination."
    "我看到他眼中的恐懼慢慢變成了決心。"

# game/storybeat.rpy:2529
translate chinese_traditional ending1_156df43e:

    # robin "I trust you, but I'm also scared..."
    robin "我相信你，但我也害怕…"

# game/storybeat.rpy:2530
translate chinese_traditional ending1_3114db35:

    # robin "Above all else, I want this to end."
    robin "最重要的是，我希望這一切能夠結束。"

# game/storybeat.rpy:2531
translate chinese_traditional ending1_5e894e3e:

    # robin "I'll do it. I'll help you catch him. I'll do anything for you, because I..."
    robin "我會做的。我會幫你抓住他的。我會為你做任何事，因為我..."

# game/storybeat.rpy:2532
translate chinese_traditional ending1_ef403a4e:

    # robin "Because I love you too."
    robin "因為我也愛你。"

# game/storybeat.rpy:2533
translate chinese_traditional ending1_ed81e2d3:

    # pro "I'll protect you, Robin."
    pro "我會保護你，羅賓。"

# game/storybeat.rpy:2534
translate chinese_traditional ending1_662a5372:

    # pro "No one is going to hurt you ever again."
    pro "沒有人會再傷害你。"

# game/storybeat.rpy:2535
translate chinese_traditional ending1_a31082d7:

    # robin "I believe you. I'm ready to face my fears."
    robin "我相信你。我已經準備好面對我的恐懼了。"

# game/storybeat.rpy:2537
translate chinese_traditional ending1_a20cefa7:

    # "..."
    "..."

# game/storybeat.rpy:2538
translate chinese_traditional ending1_57d9de05:

    # robin "Hey chat!"
    robin "嘿聊天！"

# game/storybeat.rpy:2539
translate chinese_traditional ending1_8e04b651:

    # robin "What games should we play today, hm..."
    robin "今天我們該玩什麼遊戲呢，嗯..."

# game/storybeat.rpy:2540
translate chinese_traditional ending1_553656f5:

    # robin "My roommate isn't home, so I can be as loud as I want."
    robin "我的室友不在家，所以我可以隨心所欲地大聲說話。"

# game/storybeat.rpy:2541
translate chinese_traditional ending1_97c21ef4:

    # robin "Maybe let's play a horror game!"
    robin "也許我們來玩一個恐怖遊戲吧！"

# game/storybeat.rpy:2544
translate chinese_traditional ending1_8fa86ee8:

    # "Robin starts his stream, acting as though nothing is wrong and I'm not in the house."
    "羅賓開始直播，表現得好像什麼事都沒發生而且我也不在家一樣。"

# game/storybeat.rpy:2545
translate chinese_traditional ending1_fbd13154:

    # "I hide in the bathroom. It's right beside Robin's room, so I can quickly make a move if anything were to happen."
    "我躲在浴室裡。就在羅賓的房間旁邊，萬一發生什麼事我可以迅速採取行動。"

# game/storybeat.rpy:2546
translate chinese_traditional ending1_31e1b72a:

    # "I keep my phone on, ready to call the police."
    "我打開手機，準備報警。"

# game/storybeat.rpy:2548
translate chinese_traditional ending1_a20cefa7_1:

    # "..."
    "..."

# game/storybeat.rpy:2549
translate chinese_traditional ending1_a20cefa7_2:

    # "..."
    "..."

# game/storybeat.rpy:2550
translate chinese_traditional ending1_a20cefa7_3:

    # "..."
    "..."

# game/storybeat.rpy:2552
translate chinese_traditional ending1_7b97d23d:

    # "Two hours go by with nothing."
    "兩個小時過去了，什麼都沒有。"

# game/storybeat.rpy:2553
translate chinese_traditional ending1_7b77075b:

    # "Maybe the stalker didn't bite, or maybe he just isn't watching at the moment."
    "也許跟蹤者沒有咬人，或者他只是現在沒有在看。"

# game/storybeat.rpy:2554
translate chinese_traditional ending1_1b6396cb:

    # "Or..."
    "或者..."

# game/storybeat.rpy:2555
translate chinese_traditional ending1_d5454222:

    # "Or maybe this is a stupid plan."
    "或者也許這是一個愚蠢的計劃。"

# game/storybeat.rpy:2556
translate chinese_traditional ending1_535f8ac8:

    # "But it's too late now. We're in too deep. We have to follow through."
    "但現在已經太晚了。我們陷得太深了。我們必須堅持到底。"

# game/storybeat.rpy:2558
translate chinese_traditional ending1_517d918b:

    # robin "Well guys, I'm getting a bit tired. I think I'm going to call it a night."
    robin "好吧，夥計們，我有點累了。我想我就到此為止了。"

# game/storybeat.rpy:2559
translate chinese_traditional ending1_c3996b34:

    # "This is our last chance."
    "這是我們最後的機會。"

# game/storybeat.rpy:2560
translate chinese_traditional ending1_0b5ea4a9:

    # "If the stalker is going to strike, he'll have to do it now."
    "如果跟蹤者要發動攻擊，他必須現在就動手。"

# game/storybeat.rpy:2561
translate chinese_traditional ending1_ee1042ed:

    # "I hear Robin turn off his computer, looks like the stream is wrapped up."
    "我聽到羅賓關掉了電腦，看起來串流已經結束了。"

# game/storybeat.rpy:2562
translate chinese_traditional ending1_a20cefa7_4:

    # "..."
    "..."

# game/storybeat.rpy:2564
translate chinese_traditional ending1_53d6e37a:

    # "I hear a thud, and then a loud knock on the door."
    "我聽到砰的一聲，然後是大聲的敲門聲。"

# game/storybeat.rpy:2565
translate chinese_traditional ending1_1c005a9d:

    # "This fucker is here."
    "這個混蛋就在這裡。"

# game/storybeat.rpy:2566
