    robin "更不用說你對他有多暴力了..."

# game/storybeat.rpy:3448
translate chinese_traditional ending3_a593398b:

    # robin "You... your hands were all bloody."
    robin "你……你的雙手都沾滿了血。"

# game/storybeat.rpy:3449
translate chinese_traditional ending3_064835f3:

    # pro "I didn't mean to... I didn't even realize I was..."
    pro "我不是故意的……我甚至沒有意識到我是……"

# game/storybeat.rpy:3450
translate chinese_traditional ending3_443a072e:

    # pro "I blacked out and when I came to, the cops were-"
    pro "我眼前一黑，等我清醒過來時，警察們——"

# game/storybeat.rpy:3451
translate chinese_traditional ending3_2418ba72:

    # robin "I'm leaving."
    robin "我要走了。"

# game/storybeat.rpy:3453
translate chinese_traditional ending3_14e5965e:

    # robin "I'm moving out and going somewhere else."
    robin "我要搬出去別的地方。"

# game/storybeat.rpy:3454
translate chinese_traditional ending3_cc59e536:

    # robin "I... I can't stay with you any more."
    robin "我……我不能再跟你在一起了。"

# game/storybeat.rpy:3455
translate chinese_traditional ending3_5046e8ff:

    # robin "You broke my trust... I can't anymore."
    robin "你辜負了我的信任...我不能再這樣了。"

# game/storybeat.rpy:3456
translate chinese_traditional ending3_5009e319:

    # robin "I'm sorry."
    robin "對不起。"

# game/storybeat.rpy:3457
translate chinese_traditional ending3_c4911750:

    # "I'm stunned. I don't know what to say."
    "我驚呆了。我不知道該說什麼。"

# game/storybeat.rpy:3458
translate chinese_traditional ending3_05a42722:

    # robin "I'm going to stay at a motel tonight. Don't bother trying to contact me."
    robin "今晚我打算住在汽車旅館。不用費心嘗試聯絡我。"

# game/storybeat.rpy:3459
translate chinese_traditional ending3_a5c35f8d:

    # robin "I'll be back for my stuff tomorrow..."
    robin "明天我就回來拿東西了..."

# game/storybeat.rpy:3460
translate chinese_traditional ending3_39e01fef:

    # robin "I can pay for the damages to the door you broke too."
    robin "我也可以賠償你打破的門的損失。"

# game/storybeat.rpy:3461
translate chinese_traditional ending3_82353b83:

    # pro "Robin... no..."
    pro "Robin... no..."

# game/storybeat.rpy:3462
translate chinese_traditional ending3_ecd229c2:

    # pro "I was... I was just..."
    pro "我當時……我只是……"

# game/storybeat.rpy:3464
translate chinese_traditional ending3_ed23f47e:

    # "Without another word, he turns around and leaves."
    "他沒有再說什麼，轉身離開。"

# game/storybeat.rpy:3465
translate chinese_traditional ending3_d0157b79:

    # "I'm alone... again..."
    "我又一個人了…"

# game/storybeat.rpy:3466
translate chinese_traditional ending3_f05b010b:

    # "And this time it's my fault..."
    "而這次是我的錯..."

# game/storybeat.rpy:3467
translate chinese_traditional ending3_5aef4a4b:

    # "I failed him..."
    "我辜負了他..."

# game/storybeat.rpy:3468
translate chinese_traditional ending3_e7c39007:

    # "I told him to trust me..."
    "我告訴他要相信我..."

# game/storybeat.rpy:3469
translate chinese_traditional ending3_050bae79:

    # "If maybe I had stayed up with him... or even just ran away with him."
    "如果我能一直陪在他身邊就好了……甚至只是和他一起逃跑就好了。"

# game/storybeat.rpy:3470
translate chinese_traditional ending3_d3121992:

    # "This wouldn't have happened."
    "這不會發生。"

# game/storybeat.rpy:3472
translate chinese_traditional ending3_faa87652:

    # "I... I don't even know what to think."
    "我……我甚至不知道該怎麼想。"

# game/storybeat.rpy:3473
translate chinese_traditional ending3_b39c2d35:

    # "What do I do now...?"
    "我現在該怎麼辦...?"

# game/storybeat.rpy:3474
translate chinese_traditional ending3_52323f8f:

    # "Was this the end of things?"
    "事情就這樣結束了嗎？"

# game/storybeat.rpy:3475
translate chinese_traditional ending3_60a1cb87:

    # "I guess so..."
    "大概吧..."

# game/storybeat.rpy:3476
translate chinese_traditional ending3_806de563:

    # "I'm... I'm horrible."
    "我……我太可怕了。"

# game/storybeat.rpy:3481
translate chinese_traditional ending3_db2c0ffe:

    # system "Ending 3 Complete"
    system "結局3完成"

